WEBVTT

01:33.100 --> 01:36.160
OUR GENERATION

01:36.200 --> 01:39.160
EPISODE 5

01:49.020 --> 01:49.860
Ling Qile.

01:54.240 --> 01:55.080
Feel better?

01:57.840 --> 01:58.780
Uh-huh.

01:58.820 --> 02:01.180
I'm feeling better. Thank you.

02:02.580 --> 02:04.080
Jiang Qiaoxi bought you this.

02:07.420 --> 02:08.880
What do you mean?

02:10.740 --> 02:13.020
I know what went on between you two.

02:13.980 --> 02:16.220
You two used to be such close friends,

02:16.260 --> 02:19.940
childhood companions
since you were little.

02:33.300 --> 02:34.340
You already know?

02:36.120 --> 02:37.720
Did Jiang Qiaoxi tell you?

02:41.520 --> 02:43.420
You and Jiang Qiaoxi…

02:44.640 --> 02:45.480
You two…

02:48.420 --> 02:49.260
I…

02:50.620 --> 02:51.560
He…

02:54.640 --> 02:56.000
We, for high school,

02:56.040 --> 02:59.200
will just be friends who study together
and cheer for each other.

02:59.940 --> 03:01.280
As for anything beyond that,

03:02.160 --> 03:04.180
we can talk about it after we

03:04.980 --> 03:05.820
get to university.

03:11.520 --> 03:14.340
Your affairs are none of my business.

03:15.820 --> 03:17.840
But Jiang Qiaoxi
truly values your friendship.

03:25.800 --> 03:27.300
His business is mine.

03:28.400 --> 03:30.000
His friends are my friends.

03:31.380 --> 03:34.080
When you fainted, I was just as worried.

03:50.560 --> 03:51.600
Thank you.

03:53.140 --> 03:53.980
But,

03:54.020 --> 03:55.520
I’ve got enough friends already.

03:56.080 --> 03:56.920
Don't bother.

04:31.600 --> 04:33.060
Shall we stop here for today?

04:33.100 --> 04:35.240
You had heatstroke earlier.
Let's not push it.

04:39.960 --> 04:41.920
Are you in a bad mood, Lin Yingtao?

04:42.900 --> 04:45.160
No, I'm in great spirits.

04:45.200 --> 04:46.800
I just want to learn it quickly.

04:47.300 --> 04:48.740
Get stronger.

04:48.780 --> 04:50.900
I want to ride to school with you all.

04:51.400 --> 04:52.960
I never want a repeat of today.

04:53.960 --> 04:55.280
Did Jiang Qiaoxi upset you?

04:57.600 --> 04:58.880
He is not capable to upset me.

05:01.660 --> 05:02.500
You…

05:02.540 --> 05:03.660
You didn't tell the truth.

05:04.620 --> 05:05.780
Yun!

05:05.820 --> 05:07.100
Yun!

05:07.140 --> 05:08.680
Help me check these accounts.

05:10.200 --> 05:11.240
Be careful.

05:11.280 --> 05:12.840
Don’t get yourself injured for him.

05:13.340 --> 05:14.460
Go away!

05:28.420 --> 05:29.760
We, for high school,

05:29.800 --> 05:32.940
will just be friends who study together
and cheer for each other.

05:32.980 --> 05:34.480
As for anything beyond that,

05:34.520 --> 05:37.520
we can talk about it
after we get to university.

06:16.160 --> 06:17.000
I can ride it.

06:37.060 --> 06:38.040
Look ahead.

06:38.720 --> 06:39.620
Don't be afraid.

06:40.140 --> 06:40.980
Don't hold it.

06:41.020 --> 06:42.780
Let me steady you or you'll wipe out.

06:42.820 --> 06:43.680
Don't…

06:43.720 --> 06:44.840
- It's okay.
- Leave me alone.

06:44.880 --> 06:45.880
Be careful!

06:51.980 --> 06:52.860
Are you okay?

07:00.180 --> 07:01.240
Oh,

07:01.280 --> 07:02.120
your hand…

07:04.720 --> 07:06.360
Jiang Qiaoxi, what are you after?

07:09.400 --> 07:11.220
I saw you biking up there

07:11.260 --> 07:13.140
all alone. I was worried
you might fall, so I…

07:13.180 --> 07:14.260
That's not what I asked!

07:15.720 --> 07:17.200
We had a deal that

07:17.780 --> 07:18.780
we act like strangers.

07:19.280 --> 07:20.700
We're not friends anymore.

07:21.200 --> 07:23.100
How can you just show up in front of me

07:23.140 --> 07:24.740
like nothing ever happened?

07:29.440 --> 07:30.280
I…

07:31.200 --> 07:32.920
I want to start over with you.

07:33.720 --> 07:35.400
Let's be friends again,

07:35.440 --> 07:36.500
Ling Qile.

07:39.100 --> 07:40.260
I'm Lin Qile.

07:41.080 --> 07:42.440
But am I not Lin Yingtao?

07:42.480 --> 07:43.640
That's not what I meant.

07:43.680 --> 07:45.180
Enough. I get it.

07:47.040 --> 07:48.260
Then let me say this clearly.

07:49.000 --> 07:50.320
If I'm Lin Qile,

07:51.100 --> 07:52.280
I don't want to know you.

07:52.900 --> 07:54.240
And if I'm Lin Yingtao,

07:55.380 --> 07:57.460
I wish I never had to know you.

08:03.740 --> 08:04.800
You are injured.

08:04.840 --> 08:07.300
- I'll take you…
- Stay away. Don’t come near me anymore.

08:07.340 --> 08:09.120
Every time you do, I get hurt,

08:09.160 --> 08:10.700
actually hurt.

08:12.800 --> 08:14.360
You’re doing fine now.

08:14.400 --> 08:15.620
I’m doing fine too.

08:15.660 --> 08:17.220
There’s no reason to start over.

08:19.400 --> 08:20.360
Yingtao, I…

08:20.860 --> 08:22.140
- I really didn't mean it.
- Stop.

08:22.680 --> 08:23.640
From now on,

08:24.460 --> 08:25.760
let’s just be classmates.

08:27.160 --> 08:28.260
I won't bother you.

08:28.960 --> 08:30.200
You don't interfere with me.

08:31.700 --> 08:32.620
Okay?

08:37.740 --> 08:38.620
Sorry.

08:39.880 --> 08:41.240
I really didn't expect

08:42.120 --> 08:43.419
to cause you such trouble.

08:45.380 --> 08:46.780
If you feel sorry,

08:48.500 --> 08:49.340
then just say yes.

09:04.160 --> 09:05.400
Let go!

09:23.380 --> 09:24.280
SMART YINGTAO

09:24.320 --> 09:25.720
FATHER GAVE MOTHER A ROSE

09:25.760 --> 09:27.120
THEY ALSO CELEBRATE VALENTINE'S DAY

09:27.160 --> 09:29.280
I DON'T WANT TO THINK
ABOUT JIANG QIAOXI ANYMORE.

09:39.580 --> 09:42.040
February 9th, 2001.

09:42.540 --> 09:44.420
We got a computer at home today.

09:44.920 --> 09:46.060
Uncle Cai said,

09:46.100 --> 09:47.900
"The whole world is online now.

09:48.400 --> 09:50.360
If you don’t get online,
you’ll be left behind."

09:50.400 --> 09:51.360
I bet

09:51.400 --> 09:53.660
Jiang Qiaoxi’s family has a computer too.

09:54.160 --> 09:56.460
They say you can chat with people online.

09:56.960 --> 09:59.040
I want to talk to Jiang Qiaoxi.

09:59.540 --> 10:02.760
But why he never calls?

10:02.800 --> 10:05.800
October 26th, 2001.

10:05.840 --> 10:08.140
Dad gave me three
Harry Potter books today,

10:08.640 --> 10:11.720
including Harry Potter
and the Prisoner of Azkaban.

10:11.760 --> 10:13.420
I'm holding off on reading them.

10:13.460 --> 10:15.540
I want to read these with Jiang Qiaoxi.

10:16.040 --> 10:18.820
May 26th, 2003.

10:19.320 --> 10:22.380
The news says there’s SARS
in the provincial capital.

10:22.420 --> 10:25.740
One of our classmates' parents
just came back from there.

10:26.240 --> 10:28.620
Today, he was taken home from school.

10:29.360 --> 10:32.140
- August 27th, 2004.
- Wonderful!

10:32.180 --> 10:34.840
- Liu Xiang broke the Olympic record,
- It is great!

10:34.880 --> 10:35.920
a real miracle.

10:36.960 --> 10:39.420
Watching the race on TV,

10:39.460 --> 10:40.740
I was so happy.

10:40.780 --> 10:42.600
For once,

10:42.640 --> 10:44.560
I didn’t think about Jiang Qiaoxi at all.

10:46.680 --> 10:49.340
February 9th, 2005.

10:49.900 --> 10:52.660
Today, I didn’t think about Jiang Qiaoxi.

11:01.580 --> 11:02.420
Yingtao.

11:03.900 --> 11:07.000
I never forgot our time in Qunshan,
for a single day.

11:07.920 --> 11:08.940
These letters,

11:09.620 --> 11:12.940
I’ll deliver them to you myself one day.

11:18.020 --> 11:18.880
Mom.

11:18.920 --> 11:20.020
Mom, don't tear it.

11:20.520 --> 11:21.820
- Don't…
- Get off!

11:42.320 --> 11:45.680
September 16th, 2006.

11:47.300 --> 11:49.780
I won’t let him hurt me anymore.

12:30.220 --> 12:31.940
- Told you.
- Right.

12:32.660 --> 12:36.180
You know, Jiang Qiaoxi seems to
give up on that Lin Qile lately.

12:36.220 --> 12:37.580
- Right.
- I think so too.

12:37.620 --> 12:38.540
Finally came to his senses.

12:38.580 --> 12:39.720
Exactly!

12:39.760 --> 12:41.760
How could Lin Qile
ever compare to Cen Xiaoman?

12:41.800 --> 12:42.800
In my heart,

12:42.840 --> 12:45.200
Jiang Qiaoxi and Cen Xiaoman
are the perfect pair.

12:45.240 --> 12:46.280
Who is that Lin Qile?

12:55.240 --> 12:56.820
Who is that Jiang Qiaoxi?

12:57.320 --> 12:59.800
Don't drag me in when gossiping him.

13:27.840 --> 13:30.700
You three go ahead and eat
when you're done.

13:30.740 --> 13:32.080
Don't worry about me.

13:32.120 --> 13:33.860
Today, in my great mercy,

13:33.900 --> 13:35.060
I can't see people suffering.

13:35.560 --> 13:37.460
I've decided to help you clean.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.920
Yingtao, I'll help you too.

13:41.340 --> 13:43.480
I think having you two around is enough.

13:43.520 --> 13:45.380
I’ll go grab some food.

13:47.380 --> 13:49.000
If you're truly merciful,

13:49.040 --> 13:50.540
how about getting me some food?

13:50.580 --> 13:51.980
Let a hardworking soul at least

13:52.020 --> 13:53.700
have a decent meal after all this labor.

13:55.020 --> 13:56.540
Are you going to be okay here

13:57.040 --> 13:57.980
alone?

13:58.020 --> 13:59.700
That’s a weird thing to say.

13:59.740 --> 14:01.260
What’s wrong with me being alone?

14:05.140 --> 14:07.340
Go on. I’ll be fine.

14:07.380 --> 14:08.800
- Go eat. Go.
- I am fine.

14:08.840 --> 14:10.380
- It's okay.
- Fangyuan, go.

14:10.420 --> 14:11.940
Go, go, go!

14:11.980 --> 14:13.180
Go to eat!

14:14.080 --> 14:15.000
I can do it.

14:15.040 --> 14:16.080
Go, go!

14:17.600 --> 14:19.100
Alright.

14:19.700 --> 14:21.020
We're off to "beg alms" for you.

15:14.060 --> 15:15.120
Meow.

15:19.380 --> 15:20.300
Meow.

15:27.100 --> 15:28.180
Little kitty.

15:29.240 --> 15:30.660
How did you end up here?

15:32.320 --> 15:34.840
Which angel built you this cozy nest?

15:38.040 --> 15:39.720
You can scratch its chin.

15:40.220 --> 15:41.060
Kittens love that.

15:42.100 --> 15:43.100
Go on, try it.

15:50.440 --> 15:52.440
I’ll be away for a few days
for Olympiad training,

15:52.980 --> 15:54.740
so I might not be at school.

15:54.780 --> 15:56.960
Could you take care of it for me?

16:02.600 --> 16:03.720
This is your cat?

16:04.740 --> 16:06.880
I found it here last semester

16:07.380 --> 16:08.980
before you transferred.

16:09.800 --> 16:10.900
It was so tiny,

16:11.440 --> 16:13.580
more like a little rabbit than a kitten.

16:14.560 --> 16:15.600
Just like Chunlu.

16:16.920 --> 16:17.980
Don't mention Chunlu.

16:21.840 --> 16:22.680
Yingtao.

16:25.840 --> 16:26.960
I missed it.

16:27.000 --> 16:28.720
But you already have a cat.

16:29.760 --> 16:30.640
Jiang Qiaoxi.

16:31.820 --> 16:32.980
You can like it

16:33.580 --> 16:35.040
because it plays with you,

16:35.580 --> 16:38.420
or makes that meow sound, or catches mice.

16:38.980 --> 16:41.560
But don’t like it
because it reminds you of Chunlu.

16:42.780 --> 16:44.140
Is Chunlu that replaceable?

16:45.580 --> 16:48.640
And honestly, cats are cats,
rabbits are rabbits. What’s even similar?

16:49.760 --> 16:51.560
It's not Chunlu's replacement.

16:53.500 --> 16:55.020
It’s just when I’m upset,

16:55.060 --> 16:56.380
this cat stays with me

16:56.420 --> 16:57.780
and makes things easier.

16:58.660 --> 17:00.420
Missing Chunlu is a different matter.

17:00.460 --> 17:02.320
Who are you here to miss Chunlu?

17:03.560 --> 17:04.619
I won't allow it.

17:04.660 --> 17:06.720
Why I am not allowed to miss Chunlu?

17:09.300 --> 17:10.680
I’ve kept my distance from you.

17:10.720 --> 17:12.099
I am trying.

17:12.640 --> 17:14.380
I even avoided you on purpose.

17:14.420 --> 17:16.960
Why are you even taking away my right
to miss Chunlu?

17:17.900 --> 17:19.119
Lin Qile, this is tyranny.

17:19.160 --> 17:20.460
And you are shameless.

17:21.420 --> 17:22.280
Why am I shameless?

17:22.319 --> 17:23.640
Chunlu belonged to me too.

17:24.140 --> 17:26.119
I have my own precious memories with it.

17:26.660 --> 17:27.859
You do whatever you want,

17:27.900 --> 17:29.060
but don’t push it.

17:29.800 --> 17:31.200
But you already have a cat.

17:31.240 --> 17:32.780
So what for the cat?

17:32.820 --> 17:34.540
I truly adore it.

17:34.580 --> 17:35.660
but I also adore Chunlu.

17:40.180 --> 17:41.640
How can you talk like that?

17:43.480 --> 17:44.420
- Hey.
- Stop!

17:44.960 --> 17:46.360
- Put it down!
- I…

17:47.500 --> 17:48.820
What are you doing?

17:51.060 --> 17:51.940
Back!

17:51.980 --> 17:52.860
Step back!

17:56.140 --> 17:57.320
Why are you all here?

17:57.820 --> 17:59.040
Are you going to fight?

18:01.280 --> 18:03.260
Jiang Qiaoxi, what's going on?

18:05.720 --> 18:06.960
She threw stones at me.

18:08.000 --> 18:08.900
Principal,

18:08.940 --> 18:10.460
if this happens in school,

18:10.960 --> 18:12.020
it's considered bullying.

18:12.060 --> 18:13.880
Principal, we all saw it.

18:13.920 --> 18:16.820
It was Jiang Qiaoxi
who started the quarrel with Lin Qile.

18:16.860 --> 18:17.920
Lin Qile hit him

18:17.960 --> 18:19.340
when the quarrel got heated.

18:19.380 --> 18:20.460
Just a few words of argument.

18:20.960 --> 18:22.060
Then throw stones at me?

18:22.100 --> 18:23.820
Arguing about what?

18:30.080 --> 18:31.080
She's stopping me from

18:31.720 --> 18:32.640
doing what I want to do.

18:32.680 --> 18:34.540
- Jiang Qiaoxi.
- Don't interrupt him.

18:36.720 --> 18:37.560
Go on.

18:38.520 --> 18:39.580
She disturbed me.

18:43.280 --> 18:44.640
How did you disturb him?

18:45.500 --> 18:46.540
what are you doing here?

18:49.520 --> 18:50.360
I…

18:51.200 --> 18:52.040
I…

18:52.940 --> 18:54.140
was cleaning

18:54.660 --> 18:55.900
and then he came over.

18:59.440 --> 19:01.780
Was her cleaning disturbing you?

19:03.240 --> 19:04.960
Why did she throw stones at you?

19:07.760 --> 19:08.780
She hit me

19:09.760 --> 19:11.640
because I said something that annoyed her.

19:12.700 --> 19:14.020
What did you say to her?

19:14.060 --> 19:15.440
You scolded her?

19:15.480 --> 19:16.440
So she can hit me?

19:25.560 --> 19:26.420
You,

19:27.520 --> 19:29.580
as a student, you need to
follow school regulations.

19:29.620 --> 19:30.900
No matter who he is or how good

19:31.400 --> 19:32.340
he is at studying,

19:32.840 --> 19:34.540
he can't change you
for doing what you should.

19:35.080 --> 19:36.080
Any incidents like this,

19:36.580 --> 19:37.820
should be reported to my office.

19:38.320 --> 19:39.160
No violence.

19:39.660 --> 19:40.500
Okay?

19:45.000 --> 19:46.080
And you,

19:46.120 --> 19:47.620
a tall and strong boy,

19:48.120 --> 19:48.960
were just watching.

19:49.500 --> 19:51.100
The three of you should remember that

19:51.140 --> 19:52.920
in this situation, lend the helping hand.

19:53.300 --> 19:54.140
‪-Sure.
‪-Noted.

20:02.740 --> 20:03.760
Jiang Qiaoxi,

20:04.260 --> 20:05.820
no matter how good your grades are,

20:07.340 --> 20:09.280
you can't be too self-centered.

20:09.820 --> 20:11.960
You have won a lot of honors
for the school,

20:12.000 --> 20:13.860
but our Jialin Experimental

20:13.900 --> 20:15.960
is not a place where only grades matters.

20:16.460 --> 20:18.560
You said she was
disturbing you by cleaning.

20:19.060 --> 20:19.900
Okay.

20:20.400 --> 20:21.420
I won't let her do it.

20:21.920 --> 20:23.080
You finish all the cleaning

20:23.580 --> 20:25.980
by yourself.

20:26.020 --> 20:28.000
When you are done, come to my office.

20:28.540 --> 20:29.500
No need, Principal.

20:30.680 --> 20:32.080
I can finish them by myself.

20:32.120 --> 20:35.240
I can do my own things
without any help from others.

20:35.280 --> 20:36.180
I…

20:36.920 --> 20:39.080
I made some noise on purpose

20:39.120 --> 20:40.340
and disturbed Jiang Qiaoxi,

20:40.380 --> 20:41.360
making him angry.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.420
It's none of his business.

20:42.460 --> 20:44.200
- On purpose?
- Yes.

20:44.240 --> 20:45.160
No, Principle.

20:45.200 --> 20:46.320
She didn't mean it.

20:46.360 --> 20:48.420
They were just normal sounds.
I was annoying her.

20:48.460 --> 20:49.520
Not normal at all.

20:50.020 --> 20:51.160
I did it on purpose.

20:51.200 --> 20:52.500
I just can't stand him,

20:52.540 --> 20:54.380
can't stand the fact
that he studies well and hard.

20:54.420 --> 20:56.020
- That's not the case.
- That's the case.

20:57.180 --> 20:58.200
What's going on

20:58.240 --> 20:59.900
with you two?

21:06.600 --> 21:08.820
It takes two to tango. We were both wrong.

21:09.320 --> 21:10.160
I admit my mistakes.

21:11.040 --> 21:12.240
I’m sorry, Jiang Qiaoxi.

21:13.520 --> 21:14.700
I'm sorry, Lin Qile.

21:15.200 --> 21:16.420
I shouldn't have annoyed you.

21:17.500 --> 21:18.340
Good!

21:19.180 --> 21:21.080
This is the kind of students we have here,

21:21.120 --> 21:22.740
Glad to see you two admitting mistakes.

21:24.580 --> 21:25.440
Solidarity matters.

21:27.920 --> 21:28.820
- Goodbye, Principal.
- Goodbye, Principal.

21:28.860 --> 21:30.100
Goodbye, Principal.

22:18.600 --> 22:20.220
Don’t you think Lin Yingtao

22:20.260 --> 22:22.220
is harder to understand ever since

22:22.260 --> 22:24.040
she started being more like a girl?

22:24.080 --> 22:24.920
Hard to understand?

22:24.960 --> 22:26.820
She's just making a tactical retreat

22:26.860 --> 22:28.340
to cut ties with Jiang Qiaoxi.

22:28.920 --> 22:30.500
When did you know girls so well?

22:32.560 --> 22:33.420
You guys

22:33.460 --> 22:35.320
should really read some romance novels.

22:35.360 --> 22:38.660
Try to understand the thoughts of
the other half of the world's population.

22:41.760 --> 22:42.600
Let me see.

22:47.200 --> 22:48.600
Temptation of the Man.

22:49.160 --> 22:51.340
A romance novel is called that?

22:51.880 --> 22:53.460
The title is a bit strange,

22:53.500 --> 22:54.600
but it is very famous now.

22:54.640 --> 22:56.220
Many girls in our class read it.

22:57.780 --> 22:58.660
YOUR COMPATIBILITY INDEX

22:58.700 --> 22:59.560
WITH LIN QILE IS 80%.

22:59.600 --> 23:00.500
YOU ARE HIGHLY IN TUNE

23:00.540 --> 23:01.380
WITH EACH OTHER.

23:07.780 --> 23:09.100
HIDE

23:18.900 --> 23:20.460
Is this a pirated version?

23:20.960 --> 23:22.560
The main characters are named differently.

23:22.600 --> 23:23.440
Look.

23:26.440 --> 23:27.580
I knew it.

23:27.620 --> 23:29.160
How could the heroine of a romance novel

23:29.200 --> 23:31.360
written by a foreign author
be named as Zhao Cuifang?

23:32.200 --> 23:33.260
Impossible.

23:34.260 --> 23:35.980
This is her writing style.

23:36.020 --> 23:37.520
Something wrong with your computer?

23:37.560 --> 23:38.780
Poor one,

23:39.280 --> 23:41.420
even a romantic novel can be pirated.

23:42.080 --> 23:44.260
I'll download any book you want to read.

23:45.200 --> 23:46.540
- Really?
- Really.

23:47.040 --> 23:49.140
I'll download with Yu Qiao's computer.

23:50.340 --> 23:51.340
Dude,

23:51.380 --> 23:54.340
quit downloading that adult stuff
on my family computer.

23:54.380 --> 23:55.860
Yu Jin is only nine years old.

23:55.900 --> 23:56.800
Don't corrupt him.

23:58.340 --> 24:01.040
To corrupt him, I'm not qualified.

24:11.080 --> 24:12.240
- Take it.
- Leave it to me.

24:12.280 --> 24:13.720
The rice Auntie Zhang bought.

24:14.400 --> 24:15.560
The game is about to start.

24:15.600 --> 24:16.540
Lin Yingtao'll come over.

24:16.580 --> 24:17.480
Watch for a while?

24:18.560 --> 24:20.460
Qin Yeyun, we are talking about you.

24:20.500 --> 24:21.400
- What's that?
- Shut it.

24:21.440 --> 24:22.540
Sister Yeyun!

24:22.580 --> 24:23.900
I want to give you a treasure.

24:24.700 --> 24:27.240
- What treasure?
- I pulled a hero card.

24:27.280 --> 24:29.280
It took me six packs
of crispy noodles to get this.

24:29.320 --> 24:30.740
Don’t underestimate it.

24:30.780 --> 24:33.420
This is super important to me.

24:37.960 --> 24:39.520
Yu Jin, thank you.

24:40.100 --> 24:41.940
Let's go to your room.

24:41.980 --> 24:43.800
In exchange, I'll tell you a secret, okay?

24:44.680 --> 24:45.680
Go.

25:03.520 --> 25:05.640
The game is about to start.
Don't you watch it?

25:05.680 --> 25:06.680
Qin Yeyun?

25:14.260 --> 25:15.160
Are you okay?

25:15.960 --> 25:17.100
What did she say to you?

25:19.780 --> 25:20.720
What happened?

25:26.800 --> 25:28.880
I just saw Qin Yeyun in the corridor,

25:28.920 --> 25:29.860
and she left angrily.

25:33.460 --> 25:34.940
I won't talk to her anymore.

25:35.440 --> 25:36.480
What's wrong?

25:38.040 --> 25:41.060
- Yu Jin ate six packs of crispy noodles
- I won't talk to her anymore.

25:41.100 --> 25:43.280
just to get that collectible card
for Qin Yeyun.

25:43.320 --> 25:45.920
Qin Yeyun found out just now and
they talked in his room. Not long after,

25:45.960 --> 25:47.360
they came out like this.

25:47.400 --> 25:48.920
Then Yu Jin started crying.

25:49.420 --> 25:50.860
Come on, stop crying.

26:01.260 --> 26:03.040
- Louder?
- Okay?

26:03.080 --> 26:03.920
- Sure.
- Okay.

26:03.960 --> 26:05.580
Ladies and gentlemen, you are now watching

26:05.620 --> 26:07.720
the 2016 FIVB Volleyball
Women's World Championship,

26:07.760 --> 26:10.680
the final round of the second phase
between Team China and the Netherlands.

26:10.720 --> 26:12.780
Currently…

26:12.820 --> 26:15.360
China leads 2-0, but…

26:15.400 --> 26:17.540
…with the two wins…

26:29.620 --> 26:30.460
Leave it here.

26:31.280 --> 26:32.640
I'll do it myself.

26:58.680 --> 26:59.700
Ling Yingtao.

27:01.020 --> 27:03.980
What exactly were you saying
to Jiang Qiaoxi yesterday?

27:04.520 --> 27:06.060
You two were about to come to blows.

27:06.100 --> 27:07.820
So why did you end up helping him anyway?

27:14.180 --> 27:16.300
Nice!

27:17.960 --> 27:19.660
I know why Qin Yeyun was angry.

27:21.280 --> 27:22.340
Over it. Move.

27:22.840 --> 27:23.860
Eh?

27:23.900 --> 27:25.720
This is not over yet, Lin Yingtao.

27:30.580 --> 27:33.440
So, what exactly did
Qin Yeyun say to Yu Jin?

27:33.480 --> 27:35.400
I don't know. Go to ask Qin Yeyun.

27:35.440 --> 27:37.820
How could I know what
those girls are thinking about?

27:38.880 --> 27:39.960
Why the big reaction?

27:40.460 --> 27:41.380
Giving a speech?

27:55.500 --> 27:57.240
Yingtao, Yun's here to see you.

27:58.280 --> 28:00.240
She seems a bit upset.

28:02.160 --> 28:03.960
Go inside and talk with her.

28:04.580 --> 28:05.740
Leave it to me.

28:10.560 --> 28:13.320
What is Jiang Qiaoxi
if not completely dense?

28:13.820 --> 28:16.160
Even I understood what you meant,
and he still doesn't get it.

28:17.200 --> 28:18.480
What do I mean?

28:18.520 --> 28:20.160
I don't mean anything at all.

28:23.260 --> 28:25.300
What you actually want to say is

28:25.340 --> 28:27.580
that the rabbit is you
and the cat is Cen Xiaoman.

28:28.160 --> 28:29.520
- Stop!
- No!

28:29.560 --> 28:30.720
The rabbit is you
and the cat is Cen Xiaoman.

28:30.760 --> 28:32.300
- Stop!
- That's it!

28:32.340 --> 28:33.960
Stop, Qin Yeyun!

28:34.000 --> 28:35.200
The rabbit is you,

28:35.240 --> 28:36.200
and the cat is Cen Xiaoman.

28:36.240 --> 28:39.220
- You are the rabbit! You are the cat!
- Oi!

28:39.260 --> 28:40.820
- I don't…
- Just give up!

28:43.300 --> 28:44.160
Stop pretending?

28:45.120 --> 28:46.400
I'm not playing with you.

28:58.720 --> 29:01.480
Don't mention Jiang Qiaoxi
in front of me anymore.

29:03.880 --> 29:06.760
You said you hated him
but still wishes him well in your heart.

29:11.760 --> 29:13.660
I don't wish him well.

29:14.380 --> 29:15.520
No at all.

29:18.540 --> 29:20.260
What am I singing about?

29:20.300 --> 29:22.260
Everything reminds me of you

29:22.300 --> 29:25.840
Oh, you're my greatest hit,
my anthem through and through

29:25.880 --> 29:27.720
What are you saying about?

29:27.760 --> 29:31.400
Even heard just once, I'll never forget.

29:38.000 --> 29:38.840
What's up?

29:39.400 --> 29:41.000
How did you make Yu Jin cry?

29:44.340 --> 29:45.480
I just tricked him.

29:46.120 --> 29:47.160
I told him

29:47.200 --> 29:49.340
that if you like someone,
you have to exchange secrets.

29:49.880 --> 29:51.580
So he told me his secret,

29:51.620 --> 29:53.080
and then I kinda threatened him.

29:53.620 --> 29:54.860
I said if he dares to like me,

29:54.900 --> 29:56.600
I'd spill his secret to everyone.

29:57.140 --> 29:58.120
Was that necessary?

29:58.160 --> 29:59.640
He's just a kid!

29:59.680 --> 30:00.920
Because of what you said today,

30:00.960 --> 30:02.940
he couldn't even eat his dinner at home.

30:03.880 --> 30:04.720
And even,

30:05.220 --> 30:06.440
despite his being a kid,

30:06.480 --> 30:07.820
He just likes you.

30:07.860 --> 30:08.980
Is that a crime?

30:11.360 --> 30:12.940
Yes, that's a crime.

30:12.980 --> 30:14.080
He can't like me.

30:27.720 --> 30:28.780
Whose jacket is it?

30:29.280 --> 30:30.820
Yingtao, is it yours?

30:31.360 --> 30:32.380
There's even a hat too.

30:32.420 --> 30:33.300
Throw it away.

30:33.340 --> 30:35.020
It'll just take up space anyway.
Get rid of it.

30:35.060 --> 30:35.900
Toss it.

30:48.240 --> 30:49.260
You can like it

30:49.300 --> 30:50.760
because it plays with you,

30:51.260 --> 30:53.620
or makes that meow sound, or catches mice.

30:53.660 --> 30:55.700
But don’t like it just
because it reminds you of Chunlu.

30:56.320 --> 30:57.680
Is Chunlu that replaceable?

30:58.820 --> 31:00.660
It's not Chunlu's replacement.

31:02.540 --> 31:04.080
It’s just when I’m upset,

31:04.120 --> 31:05.420
this cat stays with me

31:05.460 --> 31:06.720
and makes things easier.

31:20.060 --> 31:21.140
His being upset

31:21.640 --> 31:23.140
has nothing to do with me.

31:29.600 --> 31:30.840
What should I do?

31:30.880 --> 31:33.000
Lin Qile hasn't said much all day.

31:33.040 --> 31:34.880
I asked her to
clean the blackboard earlier,

31:34.920 --> 31:36.100
but she didn't say anything.

31:36.600 --> 31:37.880
Is she angry with me?

31:37.920 --> 31:39.480
Why don’t you ask her?

31:39.980 --> 31:41.680
It’s not like we’re mind readers.

31:42.260 --> 31:43.680
If she gets mad,

31:43.720 --> 31:45.140
you're absolutely doomed,

31:45.180 --> 31:46.020
Relax.

31:48.640 --> 31:50.100
Her state now

31:50.740 --> 31:52.000
is already terrifying.

31:52.040 --> 31:54.220
I don't even know what to say to her.

32:00.080 --> 32:01.440
- What's up?
- Ling Qile.

32:02.760 --> 32:04.180
- He's writing a novel.
- Cai Fangyuan!

32:04.680 --> 32:05.600
Why did you say it out?

32:05.640 --> 32:06.920
It's called Three Purities
and the Martial Immortal.

32:06.960 --> 32:08.100
Just search it.

32:08.140 --> 32:09.760
There's a topic. You're welcome.

32:09.800 --> 32:10.900
Go.

32:12.000 --> 32:13.740
Cai Fangyuan's online alias is "Guanlan".

32:14.740 --> 32:16.620
He also runs his own website as the admin,

32:16.660 --> 32:18.100
hosted on his home computer.

32:18.140 --> 32:20.720
He claims he's way better than sites like
Qingyun Academy or Back Garden,

32:20.760 --> 32:21.820
even surpasses Qidian.

32:22.620 --> 32:23.560
Wow, sounds amazing.

32:23.600 --> 32:24.860
Really?

32:24.900 --> 32:26.680
Better than Qidian?

32:26.720 --> 32:28.520
What's with those looks?

32:28.560 --> 32:30.200
The new generation
always surpasses the old.

32:30.240 --> 32:32.140
What's so great
about those websites anyway?

32:32.180 --> 32:33.240
I'm definitely better.

32:33.280 --> 32:35.260
- Of course.
- Great!

32:35.300 --> 32:37.700
So that's why
you've been skipping games lately.

32:37.740 --> 32:39.060
Sneakily brewing up some big moves?

32:41.500 --> 32:42.340
Go for it!

32:42.380 --> 32:44.120
Feng Letian, I helped you.

32:44.620 --> 32:46.680
You sold me out? Get out!

32:49.320 --> 32:50.320
Hello, web admin.

32:50.960 --> 32:52.060
Hello, Guanlan.

32:52.100 --> 32:53.340
Guanlan, why the silence?

32:54.120 --> 32:56.160
- Why the silence?
- No one laughs at you.

32:58.640 --> 32:59.900
How about your novel?

33:00.720 --> 33:02.540
Martial arts and immortals.

33:04.140 --> 33:05.540
Let me read it.

33:17.760 --> 33:18.600
Monitor,

33:19.100 --> 33:21.340
- why don't you help…
- Jiang Qiaoxi

33:21.380 --> 33:24.200
is attending math Olympiad lectures
these days.

33:24.240 --> 33:26.900
Who can help to collect
papers of each subject for him?

33:27.440 --> 33:28.560
Let me do it.

33:36.700 --> 33:37.540
What's wrong?

33:39.860 --> 33:40.700
Nothing.

34:01.060 --> 34:01.900
Meow.

34:04.620 --> 34:05.780
You're here.

34:05.820 --> 34:07.400
Are you waiting for me?

34:09.719 --> 34:11.400
I bring you some food.

34:18.199 --> 34:19.600
Good kitten!

34:21.580 --> 34:23.139
How was your day today?

34:26.900 --> 34:29.219
Are you happy when you are alone?

34:34.320 --> 34:38.000
Take good care of yourself
when you are alone.

34:39.900 --> 34:41.500
Eat well

34:42.960 --> 34:44.320
and keep warm.

34:45.760 --> 34:47.860
You are very important to me,

34:49.040 --> 34:50.060
so you must be

34:50.560 --> 34:52.320
healthy

34:52.920 --> 34:54.080
and happy,

34:54.760 --> 34:55.600
okay?

34:57.620 --> 35:00.040
You must be happy,

35:00.080 --> 35:01.700
healthy and safe.

35:01.740 --> 35:02.660
Okay?

35:03.260 --> 35:04.100
Because

35:05.860 --> 35:07.620
you are very important

35:08.600 --> 35:09.560
to me.

35:16.280 --> 35:17.120
SAFETY ON THE ROAD, HAPPILY TO BE HOME

35:17.160 --> 35:18.000
- Quick.
- Come on!

35:23.180 --> 35:24.500
I'm completely soaked!

35:25.000 --> 35:26.780
- Completely soaked?
- Totally.

35:26.820 --> 35:27.740
Totally drenched.

35:31.060 --> 35:32.180
Ugh, this damn rain

35:32.220 --> 35:33.920
might keep going all night.

35:34.420 --> 35:36.440
How nice! A small rain to sleep to,

35:36.480 --> 35:37.460
right, Yingtao?

35:38.100 --> 35:39.600
You two can sleep well then,

35:40.100 --> 35:41.960
but I can't fall asleep when it rains.

35:43.420 --> 35:44.640
You're so carefree.

35:44.680 --> 35:45.880
Can't sleep over this small rain?

35:46.620 --> 35:48.280
It's not the rain keeping me up.

35:48.780 --> 35:51.360
Every time it rains, the stray cats
in our complex start yowling.

35:51.400 --> 35:52.920
They keep it up till past midnight.

35:52.960 --> 35:54.600
Is there really a kitten?

35:54.640 --> 35:55.600
I haven't heard of it.

35:55.640 --> 35:56.540
- Get in the car.
- Get in.

35:56.580 --> 35:57.720
- Get in.
- Cut the crap. Go!

35:57.760 --> 35:58.700
- Get in.
- Hurry.

35:59.240 --> 36:00.080
Get in, Yingtao.

36:02.280 --> 36:04.140
ROUTE 25, TO DONGSHI ROAD

36:05.860 --> 36:07.060
You guys go first.

36:07.100 --> 36:09.120
I… left something at school.

36:09.160 --> 36:10.880
- I'll go with you.
- No need.

36:27.140 --> 36:27.980
Meow!

36:29.360 --> 36:30.240
Meow!

36:32.920 --> 36:33.760
Meow!

36:35.100 --> 36:36.260
Meow!

36:36.760 --> 36:37.600
Meow!

37:26.080 --> 37:27.200
Meow.

37:29.860 --> 37:30.860
Meow.

37:33.600 --> 37:34.680
Meow.

37:51.840 --> 37:53.800
Hang on, little kitty! Don’t be scared.

37:53.840 --> 37:55.220
I’m coming to save you.

37:59.980 --> 38:01.420
Hold on, I’m almost there.

38:28.800 --> 38:29.760
Little kitty.

38:30.260 --> 38:31.120
Don’t be scared.

38:31.160 --> 38:32.840
Come on, let’s go up.

38:33.340 --> 38:34.260
Don’t be scared.

38:34.300 --> 38:35.720
it’s okay. You’re safe now.

38:35.760 --> 38:37.280
It’s okay.

38:37.320 --> 38:38.980
Let's go.

38:39.480 --> 38:40.320
Let's go.

38:40.820 --> 38:42.500
I'll get you out of here.

38:42.540 --> 38:43.560
Go.

38:43.600 --> 38:45.120
Go up.

38:45.160 --> 38:46.000
Go.

38:46.780 --> 38:48.000
Off you go.

38:53.380 --> 38:54.640
I will go up too…

39:06.860 --> 39:07.900
Lin Yingtao!

39:08.740 --> 39:09.940
Why are you here?

39:10.800 --> 39:11.880
Why are you here?

39:12.420 --> 39:14.000
Shouldn’t I be the one asking you?

39:16.440 --> 39:18.180
Stop asking. Save me first.

39:19.900 --> 39:20.740
Quickly.

39:25.420 --> 39:26.600
Didn’t you say

39:27.340 --> 39:28.920
we’re just regular classmates?

39:30.320 --> 39:31.480
Since when do regular classmates

39:31.520 --> 39:34.400
throw themselves into danger
for their cat like this?

39:36.780 --> 39:39.100
Is this really the time for questions?

39:39.140 --> 39:40.400
Could you get me out of here first?

39:41.620 --> 39:43.400
I should be the one to save my own cat.

39:44.580 --> 39:45.680
Why didi you get involved?

39:52.000 --> 39:53.680
So you’re the only one with a kind heart?

39:55.440 --> 39:56.980
Stop lying to yourself.

39:57.820 --> 39:59.740
You and I, we were never
regular classmates.

40:00.280 --> 40:02.980
Everything you’ve done for me
crossed that line long ago.

40:03.020 --> 40:04.140
Admit it?

40:05.480 --> 40:06.620
No.

40:09.860 --> 40:11.240
The harder you deny it,

40:12.080 --> 40:14.020
the more you prove it’s true.

40:16.320 --> 40:17.240
You're so superficial.

40:18.300 --> 40:19.260
Superficial?

40:21.360 --> 40:23.580
Yes, I'm superficial. Bye.

40:24.080 --> 40:24.920
Don't!

40:24.960 --> 40:26.660
Jiang Qiaoxi, don't go!

40:26.700 --> 40:27.720
Come back.

40:28.260 --> 40:29.100
Fine.

40:29.920 --> 40:31.220
Jiang Qiaoxi,

40:31.260 --> 40:32.600
you're the top student in our grade,

40:33.140 --> 40:34.880
the math Olympiad genius of Jialin.

40:34.920 --> 40:35.760
You…

40:35.800 --> 40:36.980
You're handsome,

40:37.020 --> 40:38.040
and your voice is perfect.

40:40.700 --> 40:41.720
That's all?

40:42.500 --> 40:44.060
I'm tall.

40:45.600 --> 40:46.600
Right.

40:46.640 --> 40:47.560
You're tall.

40:48.060 --> 40:48.900
Okay?

40:49.480 --> 40:51.020
So what if I treat you differently?

40:51.520 --> 40:53.220
Most people do.

40:53.260 --> 40:55.120
Nothing special about it.
Why do you even care?

40:55.160 --> 40:56.600
The fact you are treating me differently

40:56.640 --> 40:57.860
makes me pleased.

41:00.780 --> 41:02.000
Are you done with your gloating?

41:02.560 --> 41:03.560
Do you mind getting me up?

41:04.980 --> 41:05.820
Come on.

41:06.840 --> 41:07.800
Give me your hands.

41:11.560 --> 41:12.740
I can't get up like this.

41:13.460 --> 41:14.300
You come down

41:14.800 --> 41:16.280
and I'll step on you.

41:16.320 --> 41:17.520
Me? Come down?

41:17.560 --> 41:18.620
Uh-huh.

41:19.200 --> 41:20.300
Sure.

41:21.600 --> 41:23.280
It's so high. How did you even get down?

41:32.640 --> 41:33.740
Let's go.

41:34.960 --> 41:36.560
- Come here.
- Squat down.

41:38.860 --> 41:39.800
Be careful!

41:40.300 --> 41:41.640
- Come on.
- How can I get here?

41:42.140 --> 41:43.880
- I'll lift you.
- Then I'll step on your leg.

41:49.780 --> 41:50.640
Be careful of your legs.

41:59.400 --> 42:00.240
Okay.

42:00.280 --> 42:01.480
Pull me up.

42:01.980 --> 42:03.960
Aren't you tall? Come up by yourself.

42:05.240 --> 42:06.380
And you were right.

42:06.420 --> 42:08.460
it’s your cat, your responsibility.

42:08.500 --> 42:09.480
No need for my help.

42:10.160 --> 42:11.340
I’m not lying to myself.

42:12.580 --> 42:13.420
Ling Yingtao.

42:32.760 --> 42:33.600
Mimi,

42:35.160 --> 42:36.160
come here.

42:36.200 --> 42:37.160
Are you okay?

42:41.860 --> 42:42.940
Be good.

42:42.980 --> 42:43.880
Stay here.

42:44.520 --> 42:45.920
You can’t be like her, bad girl.

42:48.480 --> 42:49.480
Don’t run off.

45:34.140 --> 45:36.140
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
